                  "content": "E713  Settings gear          —  Settings button\nE896  Load / Download        —  Load Properties from InvenTree\nE76C  Forward arrow (→)      —  Push to InvenTree\nE76B  Back arrow (←)         —  Apply to SW Doc\nE74E  Save floppy            —  Save (Settings, Mapping Editor)\nE711  Cancel / Close (×)     —  Cancel buttons\nE73E  Check mark (✓)        —  Confirm buttons, success indicator\nE703  Refresh (↻)            —  Test Connection\nE8B7  Folder / Browse        —  Browse file path\nE70F  Edit pencil            —  Edit Mappings button\nE783  Error icon             —  Status bar error severity\nE7BA  Warning icon           —  Status bar warning severity\nE72E  Lock icon              —  Read-only field tooltip indicator",
